# ── ARTIFACT CONTAINMENT ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# This repository is PUBLIC. What TWILL produces is NOT: lessons, digests,
# measurements and guard artifacts are distilled from sessions across every
# repo on the host, including private ones, and the redactor stops credentials,
# not business context. They belong under `artifacts_root` — a separate private
# repository (plan §2, §3, §7.2). These patterns are guard one of three; the
# others are the open-path test harness and a twill-ci tree assertion (§10.2).
lessons/
digests/
measurements/
guards/
